{
  "id": "6a813022e8536f1d5005ccda",
  "title": "公正な文化",
  "created": 1786851366,
  "updated": 1787992476,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a813022e8536f1d5005ccda",
      "text": "公正な文化",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851366,
      "updated": 1787992420
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81303d0000000000443d9c",
      "text": " 規則を守る",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851389,
      "updated": 1786851396
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81303e0000000000443d9d",
      "text": "  規則違反は、例外なく処罰される文化。 ",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851390,
      "updated": 1786851404
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81304c0000000000443da0",
      "text": "  一方で、故意でないエラーに対しては寛容という面も併せ持つ。",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851404,
      "updated": 1786851404
    },
    {
      "id": "6a81303e0000000000443d9f",
      "text": " 公正さが失われると、大抵の人は、規則を守らなくなる。",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851390,
      "updated": 1786851407
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8130260000000000443d99",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851366,
      "updated": 1786851366
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8130260000000000443d9a",
      "text": "just culture",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851366,
      "updated": 1786851367
    },
    {
      "id": "6a8130270000000000443d9b",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1786851367,
      "updated": 1786851367
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92995a00000000007986f7",
      "text": "正義の文化",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787992411,
      "updated": 1787992412
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92995b00000000007986f8",
      "text": "開放性（オープンさ）",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787992412,
      "updated": 1787992463
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92998100000000007986f9",
      "text": "[法令遵守]",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787992449,
      "updated": 1787992469
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92998100000000007986fa",
      "text": "批判的な自己点検",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1787992449,
      "updated": 1787992476
    },
    {
      "id": "6a92998100000000007986fb",
